OL,3,GNEWSAShed Seven to play York City
OL,4,Aground's first concert
OL,5,
OL,6,FShed Seven are to be the first band to
OL,7,Fheadline a gig at York City FC's ground
OL,8,Fin what will be the biggest show of
OL,9,Ftheir career.
OL,11,FThe band, who formed in York in 1990,
OL,12,Fwill play the LNER Community Stadium on
OL,13,F29 May 2027, with a capacity of about
OL,14,F14,000 people. Supporting will be The
OL,15,FKs, Reverend and the Makers and The
OL,16,FMersey Beatles.
OL,18,FFrontman Rick Witter said: "This is for
OL,19,FYork. This is where we live, this is
OL,20,Fwhere we're from, so we just want to
OL,21,Fhave a really big celebratory night out
OL,22,Fin our home city."
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
