OL,3,GNEWSAShed Seven to play York City
OL,4,Aground's first concert
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band were part of the 1990s Britpop
OL,7,Fscene, with their indie rock anthem
OL,8,FChasing Rainbows adopted by York City
OL,9,Ffans in the stands.
